{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert","kind":"proposition","title":"Kaon-to-pion mass ratio from Hecke characters and Seifert volumes","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-meson","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-hoefsmit-binding-amplitude"],"cites":["references/jones1987","references/kassel1995"],"tags":["meson","kaon","pion","hecke-character","seifert-volume","torus-knot","mass-ratio"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Mass.seifert_ratio_T25_T23","text":"meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert.md","leanSource":"meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert\"></a><p><em>The kaon-to-pion mass ratio factors into a Hecke character and a Seifert volume ratio:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\frac{\\mathfrak{m}_K}{\\mathfrak{m}_\\pi}\n  \\;=\\;\n  \\chi^{(2,1)}(\\sigma_1^5)\n  \\;\\times\\;\n  \\biggl(\\frac{V_S(T(2,5))}{V_S(T(2,3))}\\biggr)^{\\!2}.</code></pre>\n<p>The value at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code> and its comparison with the measured ratio are recorded in <a href=\"#rem:meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert-comparison\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mass-physical-face\">the comparison remark</a>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.37.7","page":"b/prop-meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert","qa":{"counts":{"pass":84,"fail":2,"warn":2,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Mass.seifert_ratio_T25_T23","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/meson-kaon-pion-hecke-seifert.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
